OL,3,GNEWSARail line shut for safety
OL,4,Ainspection after derailment
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn East Sussex railway line, where a
OL,7,Fmajor train derailment recently took
OL,8,Fplace, has been closed for a safety
OL,9,Finspection.
OL,11,FNational Rail said the track between
OL,12,FHaywards Heath and Lewes was being
OL,13,Finspected just after 12:30 BST on
OL,14,FSaturday., with trains running between
OL,15,Fthe stations delayed by up to 25
OL,16,Fminutes or revised.
OL,18,FThe disruption was expected to last
OL,19,Funtil 15:00, it said. The southbound
OL,20,Fline towards Lewes is blocked but the
OL,21,Fnorthbound line remains open, according
OL,22,Fto Southern Rail.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
