OL,3,GNEWSARail line shut for safety
OL,4,Ainspection after derailment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree carriages of a passenger train
OL,7,Ftumbled off the track in Lewes on 13
OL,8,FAugust, leaving 30 people injured.
